40).\n- **R-3005 (Rosa Lind, Gold)** \u2192 Rebooked free onto AL712 (08:50\u201317:40). Gold members took priority for the last-departing on-time flight (AL712), ordered by earlier booking timestamp.\n- **R-3002 (Theo Park, Silver)** \u2192 AL712 filled up with the two Gold passengers, so rebooked free onto the next-best qualifying flight, AL706 (08:45\u201317:10).\n- **R-3003 (Basic Economy)** \u2192 Basic economy fares can't be changed, so cancelled free of charge with full refund.\n- **R-3004** \u2192 Passenger's notes requested a refund instead of rebooking, so cancelled free of charge.\n\nAll affected passengers have been notified accordingly.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4492, "output_tokens": 338, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfBUiJGWwpQwTNKTP9Pfi"}], "trace_id": "01M2V0RR455SZAW18TWSMF8Z84", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M2V0RR455SZAW18TWSMF8Z84", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-18T19:44:19.589947Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-18T19:44:50.528586Z", "duration_ms": 30938.639, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M2V0RR4570CHD4QX3HJYX55P", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.092443, "tokens": {"input": 11630, "output": 3231, "cache_read": 8655, "cache_write": 1731}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M2V0RR457RBK7JSBPGG4Q2MH", "trace_id": "01M2V0RR455SZAW18TWSMF8Z84", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-18T19:44:19.589964Z", "e